  "releaseNotes": "Border thickness properties now support fractional pixel values such as 0.25 and 0.5 across dark controls, including button tab states. Adds configurable borders to forms, dialogs, virtual keyboard, LED indicators, and toggle switches. Removes minimum 1-pixel drawing restrictions and preserves integer child layouts. Border thickness properties now use Single instead of Int32; rebuild consuming applications when upgrading.",
